<title>CANADA: IMAX in US$43.9 mln common share deal.</title>
<headline>IMAX in US$43.9 mln common share deal.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Imax Corp announced on Wednesday a bought deal financing arrangement to sell 1.25 common shares at US$35.125 each for a total of US$43.9 million.</p>
<p>Closing is expected on or about March 10, 1997. The shares will not be registered in the U.S.</p>
</text>
